# ── util-linux (Trixie) — HIGH — NO UPSTREAM FIX AVAILABLE ──────────────────
# CVE-2026-76642  util-linux: HIGH — no Trixie fix as of 2026-09-21 (t/3513)
# CVE-2026-78408  util-linux: HIGH — no Trixie fix as of 2026-09-21 (t/3513)
# CVE-2026-78409  util-linux: HIGH — no Trixie fix as of 2026-09-21 (t/3513)
# CVE-2026-78410  util-linux: HIGH — no Trixie fix as of 2026-09-21 (t/3513)
#
# Packages:  util-linux, bsdutils, mount, login, libblkid1, libmount1, libuuid1,
#            libsmartcols1, liblastlog2-2 (trixie, all from the util-linux source)
# Fix state: Debian trixie has published NO fixed version for any of these as of
#            2026-09-21 (Fixed Version empty in Trivy Code Scanning).
# Exposure:  util-linux privilege-escalation / mount TOCTOU paths require
#            CAP_SYS_ADMIN or root. The container runs as the non-root aitriad user
#            with no-new-privileges under Azure Container Apps (no privileged mode,
#            no CAP_SYS_ADMIN), and mount(8)/login(1) are never invoked at runtime.
#            Not reachable in our deployment.
# REVISIT:   drop when Debian trixie ships a fixed util-linux (deb13uN+). Re-scan.
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410

